(6225960, 920472, 108580, '<td valign="top">I understand why you did this but <u>I</u> think you missed the point. It certainly is creative on the basis of your interpretation of the challenge, showing uniformity and military precision in nature. You are getting hammered right? I''m not marking this low btw.</td>', 'I understand why you did this but I think you missed the point. It certainly is creative on the basis of your interpretation of the challenge, showing uniformity and military precision in nature. You are getting hammered right? I''m not marking this low btw.', '2010-11-17 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
