(6226401, 919642, 108069, '<td valign="top">Cool photo, well spotted, air raid shelter is a classic image even in the mind. Nice perspective.<br/> <br/>And <i>1940''s charm</i> reminds me of all the crappy apartments I used to look at when searching for a place.</td>', 'Cool photo, well spotted, air raid shelter is a classic image even in the mind. Nice perspective. And 1940''s charm reminds me of all the crappy apartments I used to look at when searching for a place.', '2010-11-17 20:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
