(6232919, 920450, 20799, '<td valign="top">Congratulations Steve, fantastic shot. Feels like a real photojournalist shot from a battle. You should post this one around, I''m sure it will win many awards.</td>', 'Congratulations Steve, fantastic shot. Feels like a real photojournalist shot from a battle. You should post this one around, I''m sure it will win many awards.', '2010-11-25 08:09:54.000000', NULL, 0),
