(6234902, 920450, 119188, '<td valign="top">Great shot and edit. I was a little upset to see this category before going to the Battle of Bulge reenactment on Dec 11th in Bastogne. Maybe I can squeeze some of the photos into a different category. Again, awesome photo.</td>', 'Great shot and edit. I was a little upset to see this category before going to the Battle of Bulge reenactment on Dec 11th in Bastogne. Maybe I can squeeze some of the photos into a different category. Again, awesome photo.', '2010-11-27 03:34:01.000000', NULL, 0),
