(6235672, 920450, 108700, '<td valign="top">This photo reminds me of a quote by war photographer james nachtway<br/> <br/>"why photograph war? is it possible to put an end to a form of human behavior which has existed through  history, by means of photography? the the proportions of that notion seem ridiculous out of balance yet that very idea has motivated me"<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2010-11-28 04:21:25.</i></td>', 'This photo reminds me of a quote by war photographer james nachtway "why photograph war? is it possible to put an end to a form of human behavior which has existed through  history, by means of photography? the the proportions of that notion seem ridiculous out of balance yet that very idea has motivated me"', '2010-11-28 03:04:14.000000', '2010-11-28 04:21:25.000000', 0),
