(6484715, 919856, 46097, '<td valign="top">Yebo, I remember them.<br/>Ok, not the people commemorated by this, - but I do remember dogtags. They were with me, on the grens, way back when.<br/>Nice to have my memories woken up again, even if there is a tone of sadness in your photo.<br/>Cheers,</td>', 'Yebo, I remember them.Ok, not the people commemorated by this, - but I do remember dogtags. They were with me, on the grens, way back when.Nice to have my memories woken up again, even if there is a tone of sadness in your photo.Cheers,', '2011-07-30 07:50:09.000000', NULL, 0),
